Start with a application-layer Message
Grouped with transport layer header to create a segment to be sent
Said segment is placed within a network-layer Packet, or Datagram
The packet is then encapsulated by a link-layer header to create the frame
All of this is sent as bits across the internet

New technologies such as AI, 6G can live alongside Encapsulation, as they mainly make the current internet faster and more efficient
Others, such as Blockchain or Quantum networking will, given their drastic changes to how the internet works. No need to disguise a message for its trip across the internet if the data’s just teleported from place to place


